---
Your sensors and the ones shared with you.

Usage: hn sensors [OPTIONS] [COMMAND]

Commands:
  list         List your sensors and the ones shared with you
  show         Data points, status, battery and signal of one sensor
  create       Create a sensor (HTTP device)
  rename       Rename a sensor
  delete       Delete a sensor and all its readings
  credentials  Show the sensor id and secret for a device (owner only)

Options:
  -h, --help  Print help

Global options:
  -p, --profile <NAME>  Profile to use (server and login), see 'hn profile list'
      --json            Print JSON instead of tables (stable shape, for scripts)

Examples:
  hn sensors
  hn sensors show <sensor-id>
  hn sensors create "Balcony" --outdoor
  hn sensors rename <sensor-id> "Balcony east"
  hn sensors credentials <sensor-id>
